{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01106","headline":"相和歌辞 昭君词 · 陈昭","name":"相和歌辞 昭君词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"跨鞍今永诀，垂泪别亲宾。\n汉地行将远，胡关逐望新。\n交河拥塞路，陇首暗沙尘。\n唯有孤明月，犹能远送人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}